  "terms": {
    "title": "Terms of Use",
    "lastUpdated": "Last updated: May 2026",
    "intro": "By registering for or using the Pointly loyalty platform, you agree to the following terms. Please read them carefully.",
    "section1Title": "1. Loyalty Program",
    "section1Body": "Pointly operates a loyalty rewards platform. Points are earned through purchases at participating merchants and may be redeemed according to each merchant's rules. Points have no cash value and cannot be transferred, sold, or exchanged outside the platform.",
    "section2Title": "2. Account",
    "section2Body": "You are responsible for keeping your account secure. Your mobile number is your unique identifier. You must be 13 years or older to register. You may only hold one account per mobile number.",
    "section3Title": "3. Points, Rewards & Billing",
    "section3Body": "Points are credited at the discretion of participating merchants. Pointly reserves the right to correct balances in the event of errors. Unused points may expire per merchant or platform policy. If your business subscribes to a Pointly merchant plan, subscription fees are charged monthly. ⚠ Subscriptions auto-renew each month until cancelled. All merchant subscription prices are exclusive of 15% Value Added Tax (VAT / ضريبة القيمة المضافة) as required by ZATCA. Merchants who cancel within 3 business days of first subscribing may request a review at support@pointly.sa.",
    "section4Title": "4. Changes to Terms",
    "section4Body": "We may update these terms at any time. For material changes, we will provide at least 30 days' notice by email or in-app notification. Continued use of the platform after the effective date constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.",
    "section5Title": "5. Contact",
    "section5Body": "For questions about these terms, contact support@pointly.sa."
  },
