  "privacy": {
    "title": "Privacy Policy",
    "lastUpdated": "Last updated: May 2026",
    "intro": "Pointly (operated by Pointly Technology Co.) is committed to protecting your personal data in accordance with the Saudi Personal Data Protection Law (PDPL) and its implementing regulations.",
    "section1Title": "1. Information We Collect",
    "section1Body": "We collect your mobile number, name, and date of birth at registration. We also collect transaction data (purchases, point credits, and redemptions), loyalty tier history, device identifiers for push notifications, and — if you consent — SMS marketing preferences.",
    "section2Title": "2. How We Use Your Data",
    "section2Body": "Your data is used to: operate the loyalty rewards program; credit, redeem, and display your points balance; send transactional SMS (e.g. points received, tier changes); send marketing SMS only if you have explicitly opted in; provide merchants with aggregated, non-identifiable analytics; and comply with legal obligations. We do not sell your personal data.",
    "section3Title": "3. Data Sharing and Transfers",
    "section3Body": "Your transaction history is shared only with merchants you are enrolled with. Your phone number is not disclosed to third parties beyond what is strictly necessary. Your data is processed on AWS infrastructure located in Ireland (eu-west-1). We take appropriate contractual safeguards to protect cross-border transfers as required by PDPL Article 29. No data is transferred to countries without adequate protection without your explicit consent.",
    "section4Title": "4. Security and Breach Notification",
    "section4Body": "We apply industry-standard security measures including TLS encryption, OTP-based authentication, and access controls. In the event of a personal data breach that poses a risk to your rights, we will notify the Saudi Data & AI Authority (SDAIA) within 72 hours of becoming aware, and will inform affected individuals without undue delay.",
    "section5Title": "5. Your PDPL Rights",
    "section5Body": "Under the Saudi PDPL you have the right to: access your personal data; correct inaccurate data; request deletion of your data; receive a portable copy of your data; object to processing for direct marketing at any time; and request restriction of processing while a dispute is resolved. To exercise any of these rights, contact privacy@pointly.sa. We will respond within 30 days.",
    "section6Title": "6. Contact",
    "section6Body": "For privacy inquiries or to exercise your data rights, email privacy@pointly.sa. You may also file a complaint with the Saudi Data & AI Authority (SDAIA) at sdaia.gov.sa."
  }
